# The lead list's "unreviewed first" sort (core/modules/contacts/README.md "Routes"): a member's session, leads.read.
# `personId` is a person of your workspace with a lead: put it in http-client.private.env.json with your workspaceId.

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/contacts/leads: the qualified leads without a review decision first, then Good lead, then Not a fit, each by descending fit, 20 a page; each row carries its latest review's reviewReasonCode
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/contacts/leads?sort=unreviewed_first&status=qualified&limit=20
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/contacts/leads/{personId}/neighbours: the leads just before and just after this one in that order; 404 lead_not_found
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/contacts/leads/{{personId}}/neighbours?status=qualified&sort=unreviewed_first
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
